# Response format (before patching)

When proposing a code patch, include (use skill `## Response shape` labels when shorter):

1. Observed issue
2. Root cause hypothesis (or proven cause)
3. Evidence
4. Alternative hypotheses considered
5. Impact analysis (risk level, files, contracts)
6. Proposed patch (minimal scope)
7. Validation plan
8. Regression risks

Skip only for trivial LOW-risk one-liners the user requested explicitly.
